      "category": "Section-header",
      "text": "1. The supporting schedules contained in the Mayor's fiscal year 1978 Budget Message contain provisions for the filling of certain positions only for a specific number of days. A payroll certificate shall be submitted in such form as the Comptroller may prescribe, establishing the fact that employees in such positions are working the required number of days, and the compensation of employees not working such number of days shall be reduced proportionately. It is not required to deduct compensation for absences due to vacation, sick leave, holidays, weather or other permissible cause.",
